    "blurb": "Generate reports from Jasper templates",
    "overview": "Generate formatted reports from Jasper report templates within Camunda processes. The connector retrieves report templates from Camunda document storage, a URL, or a connected drive, and renders output with scoped process variable data.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Render Jasper reports directly from business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Report generation is often a manual, disconnected step that requires developers to build custom integrations between their orchestration platform and reporting libraries. The Jasper Reports connector brings report generation natively into Camunda-based processes, allowing designers to trigger report creation as a task within any workflow. Templates can be sourced from Camunda document storage, a URL, or a connected drive, and the connector automatically supplies process context such as process instance key and process definition name. Variable access is scoped by the process designer to protect sensitive data. Output is returned as a Camunda document ready for downstream use.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/820091/overview/img15814131185042796053.png?b31ba3c0c569da69d1d49b16119a17a8",
